    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Opening and closing signs",
     "texto": [
      "**Abre às…** = opens at…",
      "**Fecha às…** or **Encerra às…** = closes at…",
      "On formal notices the verb **encerrar** is very common: *«A sala de leitura encerra ao domingo»* (the reading room closes on Sundays).",
      "For duration, **durar** is used: *«O atendimento dura oito horas»* (customer service lasts eight hours)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
